WEBVTT

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:10.940
Damn!

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:13.820
President! Are you serious about this?!

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:16.490
I wouldn't do this if I wasn't!

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:18.330
Look!

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:19.900
It's the president's airship!

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:23.080
You won't escape!

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:33.850
Nemo!

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:43.020
President, are you really...

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:25.970
<b>Reprisal\h\h\h-Counterattack-</b>

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:28.290
Miss Sophitia's... part of Physis?

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:31.820
That's exactly right.

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:33.920
Reda...

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:47.810
What are you doing here?

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:49.720
We have a mutual interest.

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:52.310
Nemo.

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:56.200
We were never told of your escape.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:03:01.570
But that woman... Sophitia knew all about it.

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:02.680
Yes.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.270
If she was playing Germain

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:09.080
and exploiting the fact that 
you'd infiltrated Granseed...

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:14.590
It was all in order to get you
 to use Genius's power.

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:17.340
Sophitia manipulated me?

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:25.100
And I removed the seal on the old library?

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:27.020
That Legis Breaker of yours...

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:37.360
may have been the trigger 
that broke the curse's seal.

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:43.110
It isn't your fault.

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:46.120
But I...

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:48.620
Nemo!

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:50.770
Look! Over there!

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:56.300
What is that?

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:01.880
That's...

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:04.650
I'm here!

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:06.720
What's the situation?!

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:08.480
You're absolutely certain?

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:09.220
Yes.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:11.990
A vortex of magical power 
bigger than any we've ever seen

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:14.480
is expanding outward from the school.

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:17.450
Around 80% of the 
Modanto-class barrier has destroyed.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:20.990
The stability of the astral space
 is dropping rapidly.

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:25.220
Physical dimension existence 
proof is in the red zone!

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:29.190
Sixty hours to full space-time 
structural integrity loss!

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:32.890
Then the world is going to fall apart again?

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:34.620
Why is this happening now?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.380
Hey, Gareth! Where are you going?

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.370
There's nothing we can do from here.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:45.380
I'm going to find a way to kill Nemo.

00:04:56.570 --> 00:05:00.440
I understand how the president feels.

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.680
What're you talkin' about?

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:05.090
We want to know the truth.

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:06.950
We want to trust our friend.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.950
Is that so strange?

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.870
Of course not!

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:15.460
But if Genius's power 
is gonna end the world...

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:17.480
then this is what we gotta do!

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:18.780
Jou!

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:19.840
What alternative is there?!

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:22.960
Do nothing and watch the world fall apart?!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.150
But...

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:27.580
I can't play the nice guy forever.

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:30.350
I've got family. I've got friends!

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:32.280
I can't let this reach them.

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:41.290
I knew you'd come.

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:44.110
I need power...

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:47.230
The power to kill him!

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:24.650
What do we do now?

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:27.900
What do you want to do?

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:29.850
I...

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:38.550
If I'm the one putting the world in danger...

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:42.190
I want to protect you. And everyone.

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:44.920
I feel the same way.

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:49.580
Your hand!

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:52.030
The price for learning the truth.

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:53.610
Proof of my dedication.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:07:01.310
At first, I only wanted to protect 
you because of my mission.

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:05.380
But it's more than that now.

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:11.530
When I'm with you, I feel like 
I could be freed from that mission.

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:14.780
Your mission?

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:23.180
Following in the footsteps of my ancestor 
Eunomia, I was raised to protect the world.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:28.920
That's the only thing I had ever thought about.

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:34.800
But when I'm with you, I...

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:36.330
Me, too.

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:39.040
I feel the same way you do.

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:46.060
We might be kindred spirits.

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:53.130
Let's return to Granseed.

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:56.830
We must prevent the worst from happening.

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:01.830
Yes.

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:03.580
Let's go together.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.540
Of course. That's a promise.

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:14.200
Gareth, you're such a good boy.

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:17.350
You do everything your teacher asks of you.

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.410
<i>You're sure of this, Ellen?</i>

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:34.780
I'm happy to do it, Vanessa.

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:40.320
<i>I've never heard you use that word before.</i>

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:41.140
That's right.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:50.210
I'll soon reach the end 
of the future I can see.

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:57.390
But if there's even a moment 
of unseen time afterward...

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:00.140
I think that would be just wonderful.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.320
<i>Ellen...</i>

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:11.900
Let's go.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:17.590
Succession!

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:38.180
Get out of my way.

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:40.430
Hand Nemo over first.

00:09:40.690 --> 00:09:41.810
I can't do that.

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:46.810
So you're gonna let the 
cause of all this run free?

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:47.880
Jou...

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:50.690
The world's gonna end 
if we don't do something!

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:53.970
All the more reason  
we have to stop your hero!

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:55.440
Exactly!

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:56.030
Hold it!

00:09:58.760 --> 00:09:59.820
You!

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:01.430
I won't let you put a hand on him.

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:04.110
Bring it on!

00:10:04.110 --> 00:10:06.080
You can fight all three of us!

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:07.830
I intend to.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.080
My character...

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.050
is superior to yours!

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:12.840
Now go!

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:15.460
You don't have time to waste here!

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:21.930
Nemo!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:22.870
Sorry!

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:28.190
Now come and fight me,

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:29.620
Seven Knights!

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:53.970
You're strong.

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:55.500
If I am,

00:10:56.090 --> 00:11:03.010
it's because I'm now fighting to be free
 of the person who toyed with us.

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:05.510
The person who toyed with you?

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:07.140
Sophitia.

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.310
What are you saying?

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:14.820
If you doubt me, ask her yourselves!

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:20.230
I'll admit I have a few questions for her.

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:21.360
Shirley!

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:24.620
It wouldn't take long to go talk to her.

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:26.250
You two...

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:27.500
And what of you?

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:29.930
I...

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.130
I swore to her...

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:35.070
that I'd protect this school!

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:37.500
Jou!

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:43.340
What the... S-Sophi...

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:48.650
I... You don't have to... do this...

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:49.690
I'd still...

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:50.140
Jou!

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:58.890
Go meet up with Nemo.

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:00.400
Gildan?

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:03.110
Hurry!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:11.190
My hero is Jive, the Dragon Guardian!

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:14.500
I won't abandon my friend, no matter what.

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:16.960
It's my turn to stop you!

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:29.390
What is this?

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:35.830
<i>That is the Book of Time.</i>

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:40.650
<i>The seal left behind by Genius.</i>

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.120
The seal?

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:43.030
Left by Genius?

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:49.030
<i>This place is the closest point between 
the mortal realm and the gardens of Graseel.</i>

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:52.900
<i>We can now tell you everything.</i>

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:55.080
<i>Isn't that right, Genius?</i>

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:04.100
<i>The power of destruction weakened the seal.</i>

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:05.930
<i>Ironic to find you here.</i>

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:10.890
I thought as much...

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:16.060
You left no curse upon this place, Genius.

00:13:16.340 --> 00:13:21.450
<i>That was a lie to keep 
others away from the seal.</i>

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:25.450
<i>The Book of Time's seal is imperfect.</i>

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:31.830
<i>Those who get too close to the 
truth are removed from this world.</i>

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:34.510
<i>'Tis a cruel death.</i>

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:38.460
That's why you couldn't let anyone get close.

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:44.860
<i>That day, after the battle with Physis...</i>

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:52.720
Wait, Genius!

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:56.230
Please understand, Eunomia.

00:13:56.540 --> 00:14:00.730
This school and the power of 
the heroes are our only hope.

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:03.290
Someone has to protect them.

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:05.740
Let me come with you!

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:09.990
Please sing, Eunomia.

00:14:10.480 --> 00:14:15.750
Send me off with that song of yours I love.

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:23.630
If that's what you want...

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:27.600
We'll find each other again someday.

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:38.580
Little bugs who have never seen the sky...

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:45.580
Rush across the land on a journey...

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:52.810
Down an endless road...

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:59.370
That you found in a dream...

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:06.650
Little bugs who have never seen the sky...

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:10.430
Legis Breaker!

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:13.290
Spread your wings and fly...

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:20.490
We'll meet each other once again...

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:22.380
<i>Thus my soul became the binding</i>

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:28.440
On a distant island somewhere...

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:26.480
<i>and entered a long sleep in order
 to seal the vortex of destruction.</i>

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:33.020
So how does Sophitia know about it?

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:37.790
No one should know the truth, 
let alone be able to share it.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:41.560
Was there anyone there besides you two?

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:43.770
<i>Yes, there was...</i>

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:46.920
I was there, too.

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:52.200
It's been so very long, Genius.

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:54.050
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:15:54.270 --> 00:15:58.590
But that all happened 
hundreds of years ago!

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:00.970
Indeed it did.

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:05.030
But I was here in the old library
 that day all the same,

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:09.070
to use the vortex of destruction 
to purge the world clean.

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.320
"Purge"?

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:12.920
What exactly are you after?

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:18.470
To save the world, obviously.

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:21.700
I found it, you see...

00:16:21.700 --> 00:16:24.140
A way to save the world.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:27.540
A way to make everyone happy!

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:36.180
I won't let you destroy the world!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.680
You're repeating yourself, Genius.

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:44.810
But your purpose here has been served.

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:46.230
No, it hasn't!

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:53.100
Nemo!

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.540
Wait, if you were a part of Physis,

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:58.950
Eunomia would have realized it!

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:04.240
Genius killed me that day.

00:17:11.610 --> 00:17:12.620
However...

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:17.500
Throughout the ages,

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:23.810
I've used many bodies...

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:28.190
All to grant myself this moment.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:31.530
I see.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.910
You stole other people's bodies as I did...

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:38.670
Then why were you trying to kill Nemo?

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:41.970
He's the only one who can undo 
the Book of Time's seal.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:46.430
But he's also the only 
one who can replace it.

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:48.330
I need him gone.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.960
You're absolutely—

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:50.890
Faria!

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:55.590
Yes! We'll stop her and replace 
the Book of Time's seal!

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:56.930
Oh, I'm terrified.

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:03.050
Here we are.

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.230
Gareth?!

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:13.190
Nemo!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.130
Die!

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:29.410
Nemo!

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:36.320
What am I...

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:38.680
Well done, Gareth.

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:44.010
Gareth, you were such a good student.

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:45.310
But...

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:52.010
You're also quite stupid.

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:58.360
Nemo... Open your eyes!

00:18:58.360 --> 00:18:59.200
Nemo!

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:01.000
Nemo!

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:06.700
Now there's nobody left 
to wield Genius's power!

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:10.820
The seal is shattered!

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:45.460
Nemo...

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:57.950
What is this?

00:20:58.530 --> 00:20:59.930
What's going on?

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:03.440
What a pity.

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:07.010
"Hoisted by your own petard" 
is the saying, I believe...

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:09.450
Miss Sophitia.

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:16.570
Get up.

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:19.050
Who are you?

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:22.310
You want to live, don't you?

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:27.720
You were shouting that you 
didn't want to die alone.

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:31.210
I-I killed you.

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:34.420
If I hadn't escaped to that village...

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:38.280
But you're alive, aren't you?

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:40.230
Why?!

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:42.490
I'm not human.

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:44.290
I can't become a monster, either.

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:48.460
I'm not worthy of being saved,
 or of being with Faria.

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:49.560
So why?

00:21:50.510 --> 00:21:52.680
It's not your decision.

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:58.030
Can't you hear a voice calling you?

00:21:58.030 --> 00:22:01.510
Your life doesn't belong to you alone.

00:22:01.510 --> 00:22:03.470
Nemo! Nemo!

00:22:03.470 --> 00:22:04.710
Please!

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:06.710
Open your eyes!

00:22:06.710 --> 00:22:07.760
Faria...

00:22:08.170 --> 00:22:10.440
No matter how heavy your sins might be,

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:12.760
no matter how strong 
the fetters of your heart...

00:22:13.050 --> 00:22:15.680
You deserve to live.

00:22:16.570 --> 00:22:17.500
I...

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:20.520
<i>Wield thy heart's desire.</i>

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:23.260
I...

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:28.240
That's from a silver hourglass...

00:22:28.240 --> 00:22:30.680
I secretly kept it with me.

00:22:31.240 --> 00:22:33.400
What are you doing?!

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:35.500
Now rise, Nemo,

00:22:36.360 --> 00:22:38.250
the boy who is nobody,

00:22:38.850 --> 00:22:43.160
if your heart still remembers 
the promise you made that day!

00:22:44.430 --> 00:22:45.980
I remember...

00:22:45.980 --> 00:22:47.260
I do remember!

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:51.680
Faria said I should live.

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:56.820
Genius told me to embrace what I want.

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:00.610
I've been lying to everyone all this time.

00:23:00.610 --> 00:23:02.630
I didn't understand the preciousness of life

00:23:02.630 --> 00:23:05.380
or the meaning of friendship.

00:23:06.220 --> 00:23:10.930
But now I know something true.

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:13.320
Nemo...

00:23:13.530 --> 00:23:17.330
I'll protect Faria and everyone else...

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:19.000
And I'll fight!

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:20.980
With Genius!

00:23:20.980 --> 00:23:22.570
Succession!

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:28.340
My wish will finally came true!

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:30.090
Is this the salvation you speak of?

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:32.180
It's the hope that I've found!

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:33.010
And yet...

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:34.680
We won't give up!

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:36.630
Next time: "Nemo."

00:23:35.700 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Finale -Nemo-</b>

00:23:36.630 --> 00:23:39.570
Everything will begin and end here.
